      <mxCell id="cell_1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; text-align:left; padding:4px 8px;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;display:inline-block; font-size:10px; font-weight:800; color:#2563eb; background:#eff6ff; padding:3px 10px; border-radius:12px; margin-bottom:4px; border:1px solid #bfdbfe; letter-spacing:0.5px;&quot;&gt;SLIDE 16 • TRACEABILITY MATRIX&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px; font-weight:800; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-0.2px;&quot;&gt;16. TRACEABILITY MATRIX — MA TRẬN TRUY VẾT TÍNH NHẤT QUÁN THIẾT KẾ&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px; color:#475569; margin-top:3px; font-weight:500;&quot;&gt;Kiểm chứng tính liên kết toàn vẹn 100%: Nhóm Tính Năng ↔ Màn Hình UI ↔ Lớp Mã Nguồn ↔ Thực Thể Dữ Liệu ↔ Kiểm Thử&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="40" y="15" width="1100" height="75" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px 12px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box; width:100%; height:100%;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#1d4ed8; line-height:1.3; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;F1. Xác thực &amp;amp; Định danh FPT SSO&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.35; font-weight:500; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;🖥️ Màn hình: UI-01: LoginScreen, ProfileScreen  |  🧩 Mã nguồn: AuthViewModel, AuthService (Google SSO, Identity Toolkit)&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #3b82f6; font-size:10px; color:#1e293b; line-height:1.45; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 💾 Cơ sở dữ liệu: UserModel (users/{uid}), Firebase Auth Tokens&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 🧪 Kiểm thử tự động: TC-01, TC-02 (FPT domain validation, User profile sync) (Đã kiểm chứng 100% Passed)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#3b82f6;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="40" y="105" width="1520" height="115" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px 12px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box; width:100%; height:100%;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#6d28d9; line-height:1.3; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;F2. Khám phá &amp;amp; Lọc sự kiện động&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.35; font-weight:500; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;🖥️ Màn hình: UI-02: HomeScreen, UI-03: ExploreScreen  |  🧩 Mã nguồn: ExploreViewModel, FirestoreService, RemoteConfigService&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #8b5cf6; font-size:10px; color:#1e293b; line-height:1.45; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 💾 Cơ sở dữ liệu: EventModel (events/{id}), ClubModel (clubs/{id})&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 🧪 Kiểm thử tự động: TC-03..TC-07 (Accent-free search, Remote config 2&amp;lt;-&amp;gt;5) (Đã kiểm chứng 100% Passed)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#faf5ff;strokeColor=#8b5cf6;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="40" y="235" width="1520" height="115" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
    
      
      <mxCell id="cell_4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Segoe UI, sans-serif; padding:10px 12px; text-align:left; box-sizing:border-box; width:100%; height:100%;&quot;&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#b45309; line-height:1.3; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;F3. Đăng ký &amp;amp; Duyệt vé (Slide 18)&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px; color:#475569; margin-top:2px; line-height:1.35; font-weight:500; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;🖥️ Màn hình: UI-04: EventDetailScreen, WEB-02: Review Queue  |  🧩 Mã nguồn: RegistrationViewModel, FirestoreService (Atomic Transactions)&lt;/div&gt;
      &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:6px; padding-top:6px; border-top:1px dashed #f59e0b; font-size:10px; color:#1e293b; line-height:1.45; word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 💾 Cơ sở dữ liệu: RegistrationModel (registrations), TicketModel (tickets)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-bottom:3px;&quot;&gt;• 🧪 Kiểm thử tự động: TC-08..TC-11 (BR-02 capacity, BR-03 date, BR-04 approval) (Đã kiểm chứng 100% Passed)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;overflow=hidden;fillColor=#fffbeb;strokeColor=#f59e0b;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="40" y="365" width="1520" height="115" as="geometry" />
